{
 "file": "story/spt/f05_030_161_00_t011.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1041,
   "src": "9f3aad9ff3b2",
   "t": "Empty...?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1049,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1055,
   "src": "dca96c8734de",
   "t": "No wonder I couldn't set it up."
  },
  {
   "i": 1065,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1071,
   "src": "8af65f849db3",
   "t": "I thought the transfer system was"
  },
  {
   "i": 1074,
   "src": "b38f06d0a6d3",
   "t": "broken, but they really were gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 1084,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1093,
   "src": "49e9c11a3c7c",
   "t": "What's the cause?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "2a0f7464fd16",
   "t": "Someone must have taken them..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1110,
   "src": "db8a9f284b5d",
   "t": "I wonder."
  },
  {
   "i": 1118,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1127,
   "src": "825e34d3c6a4",
   "t": "From here? They took everything out"
  },
  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "e6e44fc3ffe0",
   "t": "and hauled it away...?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1144,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1153,
   "src": "0eb109957502",
   "t": "Unlikely, they're too bulky and heavy. A"
  },
  {
   "i": 1156,
   "src": "39a37a189b6f",
   "t": "big group with a plan could do it, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1166,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1172,
   "src": "f5720916e9fe",
   "t": "Could it have been cracking?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1183,
   "src": "cd0d839f7bed",
   "t": "Cracking... Do you mean"
  },
  {
   "i": 1186,
   "src": "66a1e0d057ba",
   "t": "a transfer through unauthorized access?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1198,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1204,
   "src": "be8f55742378",
   "t": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "i": 1207,
   "src": "ac8c5189b271",
   "t": "That's easier to believe, at least."
  },
  {
   "i": 1215,
   "src": "af72abfd23da",
   "t": "I figured so, and I've been"
  },
  {
   "i": 1218,
   "src": "9b826df87bb8",
   "t": "looking into it since earlier..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1236,
   "src": "34b6f162a3eb",
   "t": "But something's off."
  },
  {
   "i": 1239,
   "src": "60abc61cf543",
   "t": "It's just too normal, you know~."
  },
  {
   "i": 1249,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1258,
   "src": "2a152027e013",
   "t": "What do you mean?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1265,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1274,
   "src": "1d48080f53ce",
   "t": "No trace of entry, no removal records,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1277,
   "src": "afac68359f25",
   "t": "as if there was never a single {{part}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1284,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1290,
   "src": "75009c35a527",
   "t": "That is odd. If they had been physically"
  },
  {
   "i": 1293,
   "src": "9a8e23d06f9e",
   "t": "stolen, it wouldn't be like this."
  },
  {
   "i": 1300,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1306,
   "src": "b368003fd97a",
   "t": "Right. From opening and closing the box"
  },
  {
   "i": 1309,
   "src": "75c7a89ce94f",
   "t": "to anything else, traces always remain."
  },
  {
   "i": 1317,
   "src": "6cf38ab8214d",
   "t": "And if it was cracking, it's too skillful."
  },
  {
   "i": 1320,
   "src": "7ea7260fafe6",
   "t": "Unless it was an expert hacker, that is."
  },
  {
   "i": 1333,
   "src": "d3838666f35c",
   "t": "An expert hacker?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1341,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1347,
   "src": "e24055f69fb5",
   "t": "You look happy, "
  },
  {
   "i": 1349,
   "src": "5a0b151c2252",
   "t": "-kun."
  },
  {
   "i": 1364,
   "src": "342c20413c8f",
   "t": "Yes!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1367,
   "src": "ba86cb01c42e",
   "t": "It's my number one dream job!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1375,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1384,
   "src": "459cbbbac448",
   "t": "Are you stupid?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1387,
   "src": "7436b3cf21ed",
   "t": "...So, what are we going to do?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1394,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1403,
   "src": "f05657ecaade",
   "t": "Well, it's tough when"
  },
  {
   "i": 1406,
   "src": "6d0d01d4756b",
   "t": "we have no clues like this..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1414,
   "src": "6c2f653c6416",
   "t": "Still, gathering info comes first. Let's"
  },
  {
   "i": 1417,
   "src": "0f3058f1f7d8",
   "t": "check on people skilled at programming."
  },
  {
   "i": 1424,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1430,
   "src": "4678125258c7",
   "t": "Programming... Then the Medabot"
  },
  {
   "i": 1433,
   "src": "9183150c047c",
   "t": "Research Club first, maybe."
  },
  {
   "i": 1441,
   "src": "2ac7ffcc02cf",
   "t": "But it's {{exam}} break right now."
  },
  {
   "i": 1444,
   "src": "3dad3ac84cfd",
   "t": "Isn't everyone away?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1451,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1457,
   "src": "71beeacc486c",
   "t": "Maybe. But it's not like"
  },
  {
   "i": 1460,
   "src": "946d887f7366",
   "t": "there's no sign of anyone at all."
  },
  {
   "i": 1468,
   "src": "56cbc9d2b861",
   "t": "It may be pointless, but let's try."
  },
  {
   "i": 1471,
   "src": "7e89e746eda4",
   "t": "The longer it drags, the harder it gets."
  },
  {
   "i": 1486,
   "src": "3faaf0da07c8",
   "t": "Understood."
  },
  {
   "i": 1489,
   "src": "e0fc361ae0c5",
   "t": "Let's go!"
  }
 ]
}
